      "function": "knife_fan",
      "anchor": "if lc.is_busy(self) then",
      "condition": "lc.is_busy(self) ; for spread = -1, 1",
      "semantic": "KNIFE FAN throws three plain knives (the facing and one point either side) for its own price only, and refuses a busy captain for free. A knife whose launch pad a live body blocks becomes a melee attack() on that body instead (walker::fire() melee arm; the return is unchecked at line 171), and the fan goes on.",
      "arms": [
        {
          "when": "busy",
          "observable": "'SPECIAL BUSY', 0 MP"
        },
        {
          "when": "idle",
          "observable": "3 new knives, mp_spent 30, aim restored exactly"
        },
        {
          "when": "idle, a body touching the facing side (point-blank)",
          "observable": "2 new knives in weaplist; a melee attack() is resolved on the touching body (walker::fire() melee arm, walker.cpp:606-635): if attack() returns true (a living foe, not invincible, not cancelled by a level on_damage hook) a SOUND_CLANG event and an hp drop of the rolled amount (base-damage jitter minus random(armor), walker_combat.cpp get_base_damage/compute_damage_reduction; may be 0); if it returns false (friendly, dead, invincible, treasure, gate-cancelled) no CLANG and no hp change. Certain either way: the shot is consumed (weapon dead, not in weaplist), the attacker's myguy total_shots/scen_shots +1, and the MP already charged is not refunded; mp_spent still 30"
        }
      ],
      "setting": "new-specials",
      "status": "partial",
      "tests": [
        {
          "file": "tests/unit/test_kit_captain.cpp",
          "test": "KitCaptain.knife_fan_throws_three"
        }
      ],
      "missing_arms": [],
      "note": [
        "unasserted: point-blank blocked-pad melee arm"
      ]
